  "title": "Integra Receives Final Approval Of Exploration Plan Of Operations For The Wildcat Deposit, Advancing Nevada North Project Toward Pre-Feasibility Study - Integra Resources",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia – April 29, 2026 – Integra Resources Corp. (“Integra” or the “Company”) (TSXV: ITR; NYSE American: ITRG) is pleased to announce that it has received the National Environmental Policy Act (“NEPA”) Decision Record and Reclamation Permit approving its Exploration Plan of Operations (the “EPO”) for the Wildcat deposit (“Wildcat” or the “Wildcat Deposit”) located in Pershing County, Nevada. […]",
